Components under registry/reno/ui/ marked with source "shadcn/ui" in
docs/ui-components.md are derived from that project. They have been modified —
most substantially, sizing and spacing were rewritten to read reno design
tokens so a single component can serve multiple product domains.

Components marked "original" were written for this project.

reno-ui redistributes no third-party npm package. Installing an item makes the
consuming project fetch the package from npm itself, so Apache-2.0 attribution
travels with that project's own release rather than with this repository. One
such package is currently reachable this way:

